# Sonar quality gate

Do not weaken quality gates, coverage thresholds, or issue severities just to
greenwash a failing PR.

Never commit Sonar tokens or sonar.login secrets. Use CI secret stores.

Treat **new issues on changed lines** first. Do not expand the task into a
repo-wide cleanup unless asked.

Match existing sonar.sources and exclusions. Do not hide paths to silence
the gate.
